Meta.documentation:Content-Type.text
Meta.documentation:Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Content-Type family main for text/*: strings from bytes (UTF-8).
Meta.documentation:Found in the dawn tree by Scheme/cast when a mimetype resolves to
Meta.documentation:this family; subtype files (Content-Type/text/html, …) can override
Meta.documentation:by dropping a resource in the text/ folder.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_$all — decode bytes as UTF-8 into the value
Meta.documentation:@port out_String — the decoded text, fired on in_go
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@kind value
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Content-Type%2Ftext%20%E2%80%94%20family%20main%20for%20text%2F*%3A%20strings%20from%20bytes%20(UTF-8).%0A%2F%2F%20Found%20in%20the%20dawn%20tree%20by%20Scheme%2Fcast%20when%20a%20mimetype%20resolves%20to%20this%0A%2F%2F%20family%3B%20subtype%20files%20(Content-Type%2Ftext%2Fhtml%20etc.)%20can%20override.%0Afunction%20text()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22text%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20textProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20textProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_String%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_octetstream_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09let%20u8%20%3D%20input.value%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(input.value)%3B%0A%09%09resource.value%20%3D%20new%20TextDecoder().decode(u8)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09return%20this.out_String%3F.(resource)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.value%20%3D%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0Atext.Processor%3DtextProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dtext%3B]>>NewResource:text
